<title>BELGIUM: TENNIS-ROSSET WINS EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROSSET WINS EUROPEAN COMMUNITY CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>ANTWERP, Belgium 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of</p>
<p>the $1 million European Community tennis championship on Sunday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat 6-Tim Henman (Britain) 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
